Ek Dil Ek Jaan guitar chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood movie Padmavati sung by Shivam Pathak.

Strumming Pattern: D UUD UUD

Aaa…[G]

[G]Ek dil hai, ek [Em]jaan hai

Donon tujhpe kurban hai

[G]Ek main hoon, ek [Em]imaan hai

Donon [A]tujhpe haan [Bm]tujhpe

Donon [F#m]tujhpe [G]kurban hai

[G]Ek dil hai

[G]Ishq bhi tu, mera pyar bhi tu

Meri gaat, sath, jazbaat bhi tu

[A]Parwaz bhi tu, rooh-e-saaz bhi tu

Meri [Bm] saans, naas, [A]aab-e-hayat bhi [G]tu

[G]Mera raaz bhi, tu pukhraj bhi tu

Meri aas, pyaas aur libas bhi tu

Meri [F#m]jeet bhi tu, meri [D] haar bhi tu

Mera [Bm]kaaj, raaj aur viraj bhi [G]tu

[G]Mere ishq ke [Em]har makaam mein

[F#m]Har subah mein, har [G]sham mein

Ek [F#m]ruthba hai ek [G]shaan hai

Donon [D]tujhpe haan [G] tujhpe

Donon [F#m]tujhpe [G]kurban hai

Ek dil hai
